00:09:41.986 --> 00:09:42.819
And that's life.

00:09:42.819 --> 00:09:44.378
Life is a game.

00:09:44.378 --> 00:09:46.409
Life is a, it's a chess match.

00:09:46.409 --> 00:09:47.698
You got to go into it confidently.

00:09:47.698 --> 00:09:50.020
You can't be timid all the time, you know?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.281
I'm not sayin' just leap
out of the fryin' pan,

00:09:52.281 --> 00:09:54.132
into the fire, in every situation.

00:09:54.132 --> 00:09:56.332
You got to be smart and calculative.

00:09:56.332 --> 00:10:00.358
However, if you don't have
that confidence, you know,

00:10:00.358 --> 00:10:01.490
it's some bulls out there.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.081
There'll tear you apart.

00:10:03.081 --> 00:10:05.600
It's dog-eat-dog sometimes, you know?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:09.600
And people, just like animals,
humans can smell fear.

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.460
They can see a timid person.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.920
A lot of people don't
want to go into business

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.032
with a timid person.

00:10:14.032 --> 00:10:16.432
A lot of people can't
trust a timid person.

00:10:16.432 --> 00:10:18.002
A lot of people don't want a timid person

00:10:18.002 --> 00:10:18.885
to have their back.

00:10:18.885 --> 00:10:20.977
They don't want to be a
team with that person.

00:10:20.977 --> 00:10:24.644
I lift, I lift pretty
much five days a week.

00:10:26.204 --> 00:10:29.204
I lift, probably about, my sessions,

00:10:30.175 --> 00:10:32.865
sometimes, they can be 30
minutes, sometimes, 90 minutes.

00:10:32.865 --> 00:10:34.032
So, it varies.

00:10:35.164 --> 00:10:40.037
And also, guys, I've been
liftin' since I was a young guy.

00:10:40.037 --> 00:10:43.456
I started, I think I started
actually lifting weights

00:10:43.456 --> 00:10:45.154
when I was 12 years old.

00:10:45.154 --> 00:10:46.864
We had those concrete weights

00:10:46.864 --> 00:10:49.372
with the plastic that covers it.

00:10:49.372 --> 00:10:52.007
You know, the sun kind
of cracks the plastic,

00:10:52.007 --> 00:10:54.947
and every time you do a curl,
a chunk of cement falls out,

00:10:54.947 --> 00:10:56.860
so the weight's imbalanced.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:00.267
One thing I can say about
my lifting regiment,

00:11:00.267 --> 00:11:02.189
is I am very consistent.

00:11:02.189 --> 00:11:03.617
I can't think of a time in my life

00:11:03.617 --> 00:11:05.289
that I haven't been training,

00:11:05.289 --> 00:11:08.429
and that's every group
of friends I've ever had.

00:11:08.429 --> 00:11:10.008
I'm the ringleader when
it comes to training.

00:11:10.008 --> 00:11:11.390
Like, everybody's training,
'cause I'm around.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.600
So, I've been lifting forever.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:19.296
I'm thinkin' about makin'
the hardest thing look easy.

00:11:19.296 --> 00:11:21.839
So, if you're ever around me when I train,

00:11:21.839 --> 00:11:23.786
a lot of times, I'm psyching myself up.

00:11:23.786 --> 00:11:25.145
I'm like, this is easy!

00:11:25.145 --> 00:11:26.346
This is ****** easy!

00:11:26.346 --> 00:11:27.826
This is a ****** warm up!

00:11:27.826 --> 00:11:29.115
Give me more weight!

00:11:29.115 --> 00:11:32.697
I say that to myself, and
I believe it, you know?

00:11:32.697 --> 00:11:34.395
Anything you put in
your subconscious mind,

00:11:34.395 --> 00:11:35.863
it becomes a reality.

00:11:35.863 --> 00:11:38.795
So, I tell myself,
constantly, this is easy.

00:11:38.795 --> 00:11:39.965
This is easy.

00:11:39.965 --> 00:11:41.715
No matter what the task is.

00:11:41.715 --> 00:11:46.185
Now, you take that, it's
bigger than the gym, okay?

00:11:46.185 --> 00:11:49.575
This is a direct parallel to
life, to everyday situations,

00:11:49.575 --> 00:11:52.834
whether it be work, school, relationships,

00:11:52.834 --> 00:11:54.834
facin' a conflict, okay?

00:11:54.834 --> 00:11:58.912
When you consciously put yourself
through a difficult task,

00:11:58.912 --> 00:12:02.045
say, like a really difficult
workout in the gym,

00:12:02.045 --> 00:12:04.258
when it's somethin' positive for you,

00:12:04.258 --> 00:12:06.127
you constantly put yourself through that,

00:12:06.127 --> 00:12:09.486
you will be able to,
like, outside the gym,

00:12:09.486 --> 00:12:11.027
handle any situation,

00:12:11.027 --> 00:12:13.439
because you've developed
that mental toughness.

00:12:13.439 --> 00:12:15.279
It's way more than physical,

00:12:15.279 --> 00:12:17.115
and that's what I try to get across.

00:12:17.115 --> 00:12:19.929
My training, the way I train, is yeah,

00:12:19.929 --> 00:12:22.059
I want to be physically
fit, I want to be strong,

00:12:22.059 --> 00:12:23.920
I want to be healthy, I want to look good.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:26.218
But also, I want a strong mind, okay?

00:12:26.218 --> 00:12:27.954
And I tell people all the time,

00:12:27.954 --> 00:12:31.871
train your mind as hard
as you train your body.

00:12:32.787 --> 00:12:34.069
- Thank you guys so much for watching!

00:12:34.069 --> 00:12:36.838
